{"c":[{"name":"20261004T153943Z-e96b8d822d84ddbb","text":"D2-03: an event card whose time is open (no AM/PM, no end) is figure needsYou with a choices block; the host's closed-line Tab sends no variants row, so the helper adds nothing and re-offers the card under a new key (offerWithdrawn reoffered).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T171742Z-0e49751b5685c975","text":"B23: only a consumer hello with host: true counts as the host; other consumers bind their own work but keep no run with no Tab alive. v2/host must send host: true, or no skill runs on its own. In-process evals still call helper.hostConnected(id).","type":"note"}]}
